        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Energy Conversion"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, arcane)\n\nWhenever the calikang is hit by an electricity spell's attack roll or rolls a successful save against a spell that deals electricity damage, they absorb the energy. This heals the calikang for an amount of HP equal to quadruple the spell's level and recharges their Breath Weapon. A calikang can't absorb their own spells this way."
            },
            "id": "d5e2ab08-1d77-4b52-b3c2-ff3bef206d00",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:27.494111"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Suspended Animation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nBy concentrating for 5 minutes, the calikang can enter a state of suspended animation, freezing in place and becoming motionless but remaining aware of their surroundings. While in this state, the calikang gains a +4 status bonus to Fortitude saves; doesn't age; and is immune to disease, inhaled toxins, poison, starvation, and thirst. The calikang can exit suspended animation as a free action. If they exit this state to attack, the calikang gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their initiative roll."
            },
            "id": "8f6d9bdf-4edb-4e2a-af21-4c12e10c1361",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:27.494111"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
