            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(acid, arcane, cold, electricity, evocation, fire, sonic)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe calikang breathes a blast of energy that deals 13d6 energy damage to creatures in a 60-foot line (DC 28 basic Reflex save). The calikang can choose the damage type each time: acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic. Increase the die size to d8 if the calikang chooses electricity."
